Edge of the Battlefield~
   Winds whip by as you look into the abyss which surrounds these fields of
chaos where the forces of good and evil fight for supreme rule of the world.  
The ground here is stained a dark red from the blood of countless victims that
have fallen.  To the north is a fissure in the rock, that seems to open into
some type of ....  Space.  The fissure is to small for you to crawl through,
but you can most certainly &15Pure into the Fissure&00.    
